let ANGLE = 15;

axiom X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0) Plus X(0);

match X(c) then [ Color(c) F Plus F Plus F Plus F [ Minus Minus Minus X(c + 1) Minus Y(c + 1) ] Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus F Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus F Minus F Minus F Minus F ];
match Y(c) then [ Color(c) F Plus F Plus F Plus F [ Minus Minus Minus Y(c + 1) ] Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus F Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus Plus F Minus F Minus F Minus F ];
